  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "WATERCOLOR – Second Wind<br>Beautiful Home in the Camp District | Sleeps 8<br><br>DESCRIPTION<br>Second Wind is a stunning Watercolor home located in the highly sought-after Camp District. With its spacious design, this professionally decorated home is just a block from Camp Watercolor and steps away from tennis courts. The home offers the perfect combination of modern amenities, coastal charm, and easy access to the best of Watercolor.<br><br>OUTDOOR LIVING & BEACH ACCESS<br>Relax on the large screened-in porch, enjoy the porch swing, or dine al fresco with serene views. This home also includes 4 bikes for use during your stay. The WaterColor Beach Club is nearby, providing easy beach access and pools.<br><br>HOME FEATURES<br>✔ 3 bedrooms | 2 full + 1 half bathrooms | Sleeps 8<br>✔ Gourmet kitchen with granite countertops, gas range, separate ice maker, and beverage cooler<br>✔ Spacious screened-in porch with outdoor seating and swing<br>✔ 4 bikes for guest use<br>✔ Cozy coastal design with beautiful, soothing tones throughout<br>✔ Smart TVs, and WiFi<br><br>DINING & ENTERTAINMENT<br>✔ Access to WaterColor Beach Club with pools, dining, and drinks at WaterColor Grill and Costa Chica<br>✔ Access to Camp Watercolor's lazy river, zero-entry pool, and The Canteen dining<br><br>WHY STAY HERE?<br>✔ Spacious, family-friendly design with room for everyone<br>✔ Perfect location near the best of WaterColor's amenities and beaches<br>✔ A beautifully designed home offering comfort, style, and relaxation<br><br>SLEEPING ACCOMMODATIONS<br>✔ 1 King bedrooms<br>✔ 1 Queen bedroom<br>✔ 1 room with two twin bunk beds<br><br>Second Wind is the ideal place to unwind, offering everything you need for an unforgettable Watercolor experience.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Charming Retreat in the Heart of the Camp District"
        }
      ],
